  "implementation": "Private normalized arc-length clouds and monotone quintic station clocks propose one shared simple cubic basis. Existing usd-brep constrained least squares, bounded parameter correction and geometric refitting retain hard contacts and endpoint derivatives. Fresh sampled point distances gate the fit; exact rational restored-curve certificates qualify every prescribed contact. Complete pre-fit original-image certificates separately gate downstream surface regression and diagnostic admission. No global native tolerance or certificate work limit changes.",
